import InitECandidate.Solver.GuestBound.Dispatch

/-!
# `op_dispatch` from the handler theorems

Generated by `tools/gen-frame-ops.py`. `provedOps` are the handlers proved in
`SepFrameOps.lean`; `restOps` are the others. `op_dispatch_frame` gives the
dispatcher's outcome once the handlers in `restOps` have theirs.
-/

